{"id":"9fac26f38881e020","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-effective-quotient.md","title":"Effective quotient","display":"df-effective-quotient — Effective quotient","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-effective-quotient","aliases":["16-df-effective-quotient","Effective quotient"],"display":"df-effective-quotient — Effective quotient","depends_on":["[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"§4.7 pp.283–284 (PDF303–304); §4.8; explicit finite-limit categorical formulation","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-effective-quotient"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-effective-quotient</span><span>Effective quotient</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-quotient — Effective quotient"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§4.7 pp.283–284 (PDF303–304); §4.8; explicit finite-limit categorical formulation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为有限极限范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\langle r_1,r_2\\rangle:R\\rightarrowtail X\\times X\">\\(m=\\langle r_1,r_2\\rangle:R\\rightarrowtail X\\times X\\)</span> 是内部等价关系：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:X\\to R\">\\(d:X\\to R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:R\\to R\">\\(s:R\\to R\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:R\\times_XR\\to R\">\\(t:R\\times_XR\\to R\\)</span>，其中拉回沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_2,r_1\">\\(r_2,r_1\\)</span>，满足下列方程。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:X\\to Q\">\\(q:X\\to Q\\)</span> 为候选商。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coeq},\\mathrm{EffQuot}\">\\(\\mathrm{Coeq},\\mathrm{EffQuot}\\)</span> 为下文定义的泛性质谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nr_1d=r_2d=\\operatorname{id}_X,\\qquad r_1s=r_2,\\quad r_2s=r_1,\\\\\nr_1t=r_1\\pi_1,\\qquad r_2t=r_2\\pi_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal C}(r_1,r_2;q)\\Longleftrightarrow\nqr_1=qr_2\\land(\\forall Z)(\\forall h:X\\to Z)\n\\bigl[hr_1=hr_2\\Rightarrow(\\exists!k:Q\\to Z)\\ kq=h\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{EffQuot}_{\\mathcal C}(R,r_1,r_2;q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal C}(r_1,r_2;q)\\land\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal C}(r_1,r_2;q,q),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EffQuot}(R,q)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EffQuot}_{\\mathcal C}(R,r_1,r_2;q).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nr_1d=r_2d=\\operatorname{id}_X,\\qquad r_1s=r_2,\\quad r_2s=r_1,\\\\\nr_1t=r_1\\pi_1,\\qquad r_2t=r_2\\pi_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal C}(r_1,r_2;q)\\Longleftrightarrow\nqr_1=qr_2\\land(\\forall Z)(\\forall h:X\\to Z)\n\\bigl[hr_1=hr_2\\Rightarrow(\\exists!k:Q\\to Z)\\ kq=h\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{EffQuot}_{\\mathcal C}(R,r_1,r_2;q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal C}(r_1,r_2;q)\\land\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal C}(r_1,r_2;q,q),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EffQuot}(R,q)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EffQuot}_{\\mathcal C}(R,r_1,r_2;q).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有效性要求该关系的指定两投影组成核偶，不能仅要求关系的载体与核偶载体偶然同构。余等化子的图条件已直接展开。原书 §4.7 pp.283–284 (PDF303–304) 及 §4.8 的 full quotient 对应通常范畴论有效商；本页是其普通有限极限范畴表述。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为有限极限范畴，$\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal C}$、$\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal C}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。$m=\\langle r_1,r_2\\rangle:R\\rightarrowtail X\\times X$ 是内部等价关系：给定 $d:X\\to R$、$s:R\\to R$ 与 $t:R\\times_XR\\to R$，其中拉回沿 $r_2,r_1$，满足下列方程。$q:X\\to Q$ 为候选商。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"m=\\langle r_1,r_2\\rangle:R\\rightarrowtail X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"d:X\\to R","display":false},{"tex":"s:R\\to R","display":false},{"tex":"t:R\\times_XR\\to R","display":false},{"tex":"r_2,r_1","display":false},{"tex":"q:X\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Coeq},\\mathrm{EffQuot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nr_1d=r_2d=\\operatorname{id}_X,\\qquad r_1s=r_2,\\quad r_2s=r_1,\\\\\nr_1t=r_1\\pi_1,\\qquad r_2t=r_2\\pi_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal C}(r_1,r_2;q)\\Longleftrightarrow\nqr_1=qr_2\\land(\\forall Z)(\\forall h:X\\to Z)\n\\bigl[hr_1=hr_2\\Rightarrow(\\exists!k:Q\\to Z)\\ kq=h\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{EffQuot}_{\\mathcal C}(R,r_1,r_2;q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal C}(r_1,r_2;q)\\land\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal C}(r_1,r_2;q,q),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EffQuot}(R,q)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EffQuot}_{\\mathcal C}(R,r_1,r_2;q).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1768,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-195","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-effective-quotient|df-effective-quotient — Effective quotient]]"}],"outgoing":["dacf0503b95c88a9"]}